WEBVTT

00:00:05.590 --> 00:00:09.580
<i>And so, after much ado, 
Tania joined our party.</i>

00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:13.900
<i>And the first job we took on as a trio was...</i>

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:23.140
No luck. There was just one over here.

00:00:24.930 --> 00:00:27.000
<i>...exterminating slimes.</i>

00:00:30.170 --> 00:00:39.850
<b>Beast Tamer</b>

00:01:57.050 --> 00:02:01.720
<b>F-rank</b>

00:01:57.620 --> 00:02:01.720
<i>Slimes themselves are F-rank 
monsters that anyone can beat...</i>

00:02:02.220 --> 00:02:07.310
Dragonoid Power

00:02:02.320 --> 00:02:04.940
<i>...which means most adventurers 
don't bother with them.</i>

00:02:04.940 --> 00:02:07.690
<i>But if they're left untouched for too 
long, they can turn into a swarm.</i>

00:02:08.310 --> 00:02:12.790
<i>It's common to see these slimes 
ravaging farmers' fields.</i>

00:02:13.270 --> 00:02:15.450
Slimes, huh?

00:02:15.450 --> 00:02:18.780
What's this, Kanade? 
You afraid of slimes?

00:02:18.780 --> 00:02:20.270
No!

00:02:20.270 --> 00:02:23.070
I can beat slimes no problem!

00:02:23.070 --> 00:02:23.740
But...

00:02:25.280 --> 00:02:31.210
I just hate how they're all jiggly and 
wiggly and fighting them leaves me all sticky!

00:02:31.640 --> 00:02:34.250
That <i>is</i> the inevitable result 
of fighting them physically.

00:02:34.250 --> 00:02:38.540
I'll just mow them down myself with 
my fireballs and flame breath!

00:02:38.540 --> 00:02:40.120
You can rest easy!

00:02:40.120 --> 00:02:41.230
You mean it?!

00:02:41.230 --> 00:02:43.540
I can count on you, Tania!

00:02:44.520 --> 00:02:46.650
Keep it coming! More compliments!

00:02:46.650 --> 00:02:49.140
You're amazing, Tania! 
You're the best, Tania!

00:02:48.080 --> 00:02:51.620
<i>I wasn't sure, at first, 
if they'd actually get along,</i>

00:02:52.070 --> 00:02:54.110
<i>but I think we might just make it!</i>

00:02:55.620 --> 00:02:57.200
Let's see...

00:02:59.330 --> 00:03:02.060
Still no slimes!

00:03:02.060 --> 00:03:05.080
I thought a swarm would be a 
little more easily found...

00:03:05.640 --> 00:03:08.270
Oh, well. We'll try from above.

00:03:08.270 --> 00:03:09.540
From above?

00:03:10.640 --> 00:03:12.750
You're going to have the bird look?

00:03:13.280 --> 00:03:15.770
No. Since I have the two of you here,

00:03:15.770 --> 00:03:17.900
I thought I'd assimilate 
and search around myself.

00:03:17.900 --> 00:03:18.710
"Assimilate"?

00:03:35.490 --> 00:03:36.780
Hey!

00:03:36.780 --> 00:03:37.580
Rein?

00:03:37.580 --> 00:03:40.190
Rein looks like a puppet 
with its strings cut!

00:03:40.190 --> 00:03:41.530
Wh-What happened?!

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:44.110
I'm right here, you two!

00:03:45.820 --> 00:03:48.300
Rein became a bird!

00:03:48.300 --> 00:03:49.790
Not quite, I'm afraid...

00:03:50.620 --> 00:03:53.040
I transferred part of my soul into the bird,

00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:54.780
and assigned my consciousness to it.

00:03:54.780 --> 00:03:57.590
It lets me use the bird's body as my own.

00:03:58.230 --> 00:04:01.370
This is "assimilate," 
one of a beast tamer's skills.

00:04:01.850 --> 00:04:05.470
In order to converse, I'm using 
magic to send out thought waves.

00:04:05.470 --> 00:04:06.550
Magic...

00:04:07.020 --> 00:04:09.740
You can even do that, Rein?

00:04:09.740 --> 00:04:11.300
Unbelievable!

00:04:11.730 --> 00:04:12.570
Yeah.

00:04:12.570 --> 00:04:14.770
Your abilities are truly exceptional.

00:04:14.770 --> 00:04:15.820
They are?

00:04:15.820 --> 00:04:17.110
Most beast tamers—

00:04:17.110 --> 00:04:18.560
—can't do it!

00:04:19.310 --> 00:04:21.780
I-I'm going to find those slimes!

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:24.950
Watch my body in the meantime, okay?

00:04:25.930 --> 00:04:28.650
Rein sure is something else!

00:04:28.650 --> 00:04:30.240
He sure is...

00:04:37.890 --> 00:04:40.080
There are so many.

00:04:40.080 --> 00:04:42.090
When I found them, 
I felt a chill up my spine.

00:04:43.380 --> 00:04:44.960
Let's take care of them!

00:04:44.960 --> 00:04:45.970
But first...

00:04:46.440 --> 00:04:48.580
Can you cast spells, Rein?

00:04:49.350 --> 00:04:52.430
I can cast beginner stuff like Heal and Fireball.

00:04:52.430 --> 00:04:56.650
I tried to learn long ago, but that 
was about all I could handle.

00:04:57.290 --> 00:04:58.600
I see.

00:04:58.600 --> 00:04:59.500
In that case...

00:04:59.860 --> 00:05:03.440
Try attacking those slimes 
with your Fireball!

00:05:03.440 --> 00:05:05.570
Huh? It's not very powerful, though...

00:05:05.570 --> 00:05:07.520
Just go on! Give it a try!

00:05:07.520 --> 00:05:09.440
F-Fine! Just don't push me!

00:05:09.440 --> 00:05:11.490
I'm gonna fall into the slimes!

00:05:15.910 --> 00:05:17.320
<i>Let's see.</i>

00:05:17.320 --> 00:05:19.130
<i>Focus magic in your hand...</i>

00:05:20.050 --> 00:05:22.410
<i>Form the magic circle...</i>

00:05:23.140 --> 00:05:24.090
<i>Then...</i>

00:05:24.430 --> 00:05:25.920
<i>let it fly!</i>

00:05:26.480 --> 00:05:27.800
Fireball!

00:05:36.020 --> 00:05:38.030
Wh-What the heck happened?!

00:05:38.030 --> 00:05:39.730
It wasn't even a fight!

00:05:40.060 --> 00:05:41.190
Just as I thought.

00:05:41.840 --> 00:05:47.320
Your contract with Kanade gave you the 
physical abilities of a cat spirit, remember?

00:05:47.320 --> 00:05:48.360
Right...

00:05:48.640 --> 00:05:51.700
It stands to reason that your 
contract with me would give you

00:05:52.090 --> 00:05:54.000
the magical abilities of a dragonoid.

00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:58.460
My fireballs and fire breath 
are powered by magic, too.

00:05:58.460 --> 00:06:01.150
The magic power of the dragonoids 
is the second-highest

00:06:01.150 --> 00:06:03.050
of all of the ultimate species.

00:06:03.420 --> 00:06:06.340
That power now lives within you!

00:06:06.730 --> 00:06:08.880
Second-highest... magic power?

00:06:08.880 --> 00:06:11.350
It's no use. I can't keep 
up with what she's saying!

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:12.970
They're back!

00:06:13.370 --> 00:06:15.970
Good timing. We'll use them for practice.

00:06:16.460 --> 00:06:19.800
Magic is harder to use 
than physical abilities.

00:06:19.800 --> 00:06:22.190
You still can't control it well, can you?

00:06:22.190 --> 00:06:23.850
Well, no...

00:06:23.850 --> 00:06:25.500
I know it might be hard,

00:06:25.500 --> 00:06:26.650
but give it your best shot.

00:06:27.040 --> 00:06:29.860
You're our master, after all!

00:06:31.910 --> 00:06:33.070
<i>That's right.</i>

00:06:33.070 --> 00:06:37.290
<i>I don't want to be an embarrassment 
beside my two ultimate species.</i>

00:06:37.920 --> 00:06:39.660
<i>I want to be better!</i>

00:06:40.770 --> 00:06:43.880
Tania. Teach me how to use magic!

00:06:43.880 --> 00:06:46.640
I'm a strict teacher, so you'd better be ready!

00:06:46.640 --> 00:06:48.970
Go for it, Rein! Fight!

00:06:49.280 --> 00:06:51.370
<i>But the way Tania taught...</i>

00:06:51.370 --> 00:06:52.220
Fireball!

00:06:54.350 --> 00:06:56.830
More focus!

00:06:56.830 --> 00:06:58.660
Keep that posture steady!

00:07:02.310 --> 00:07:03.530
There's more coming!

00:07:03.530 --> 00:07:04.520
Go on! Focus!

00:07:04.910 --> 00:07:06.980
F-Fireball!

00:07:06.980 --> 00:07:09.680
<i>...was seriously harsh...</i>

00:07:09.680 --> 00:07:13.750
<i>But it did teach me to control 
my magic a lot better!</i>

00:07:15.390 --> 00:07:17.050
Hey, cat lady!

00:07:17.620 --> 00:07:18.940
What are you doing?

00:07:19.310 --> 00:07:22.090
We finished our job, so we 
came to report in about it.

00:07:23.540 --> 00:07:25.150
Hey, dragon lady!

00:07:25.150 --> 00:07:26.990
What did you beat today?

00:07:26.990 --> 00:07:27.800
Slimes.

00:07:28.200 --> 00:07:32.630
Oh! My mom says they eat the 
vegetables in the fields.

00:07:33.160 --> 00:07:35.080
They're all gone now, fortunately.

00:07:35.080 --> 00:07:37.160
You'll be able to eat lots of veggies now!

00:07:37.160 --> 00:07:38.010
Yeah!

00:07:38.010 --> 00:07:40.200
But I like meat better.

00:07:40.200 --> 00:07:41.640
I do, too!

00:07:41.640 --> 00:07:42.570
Me, too!

00:07:42.570 --> 00:07:44.940
Yay! We're the same!

00:07:46.890 --> 00:07:47.940
I'm back!

00:07:48.530 --> 00:07:51.110
We got a pretty big reward for that one.

00:07:59.650 --> 00:08:04.960
<i>People accept Tania if we tell them she's 
a slightly odd girl in a dragonoid costume.</i>

00:08:05.600 --> 00:08:08.800
<i>She still comes close to outing 
herself now and then, but...</i>

00:08:08.800 --> 00:08:10.670
<i>I think we'll be okay for now.</i>

00:08:27.960 --> 00:08:30.690
<i>I guess ultimate species 
have ultimate stomachs, too!</i>

00:08:31.600 --> 00:08:33.150
Thanks for the meal!

00:08:33.620 --> 00:08:35.320
I'm so full!

00:08:35.320 --> 00:08:37.800
Even the food is wonderful in the city.

00:08:37.800 --> 00:08:39.620
Great work today, you two.

00:08:39.980 --> 00:08:43.660
Though you're the one who 
found <i>and</i> beat the slimes.

00:08:44.140 --> 00:08:46.920
Only because you taught me how to use magic.

00:08:46.920 --> 00:08:48.760
I really owe you for that.

00:08:48.760 --> 00:08:51.080
N-No need to thank me.

00:08:51.080 --> 00:08:53.500
That's just what comrades do.

00:08:53.500 --> 00:08:55.010
I guess you're right there!

00:08:55.340 --> 00:08:58.180
Where did you learn beast taming, Rein?

00:08:58.700 --> 00:09:01.500
I've been wondering the same thing myself!

00:09:02.550 --> 00:09:04.890
I don't think it's a particularly 
interesting story.

00:09:05.260 --> 00:09:07.280
Please. Just tell us!

00:09:07.280 --> 00:09:08.940
Tell us! Tell us!

00:09:09.960 --> 00:09:10.690
Okay.

00:09:12.120 --> 00:09:15.650
I learned beast taming in 
the village I came from.

00:09:16.690 --> 00:09:19.120
A village full of beast tamers.

00:09:19.860 --> 00:09:23.580
My parents were beast tamers, too.

00:09:24.110 --> 00:09:28.540
So I can't remember a time when 
I wasn't learning beast taming.

00:09:28.910 --> 00:09:31.460
The insect tamer power I showed to Kanade

00:09:31.460 --> 00:09:33.510
was also something I learned from 
someone else in the village.

00:09:35.290 --> 00:09:37.720
It was a small village without a name,

00:09:37.720 --> 00:09:39.180
but it was a good place.

00:09:39.680 --> 00:09:40.810
<i>Was</i>?

00:09:44.120 --> 00:09:45.590
My hometown...

00:09:46.440 --> 00:09:48.100
no longer exists.

00:09:51.870 --> 00:09:55.900
I... I didn't know it would 
be such a serious story.

00:09:55.900 --> 00:09:56.860
I'm sorry.

00:09:57.200 --> 00:09:59.240
Don't worry. I get it.

00:09:59.820 --> 00:10:02.750
And... I know it might sound like an excuse,

00:10:02.750 --> 00:10:04.910
but I didn't ask out of idle curiosity.

00:10:04.910 --> 00:10:09.280
I just wanted to know more about you.

00:10:09.790 --> 00:10:11.920
I feel the same way Kanade does.

00:10:11.920 --> 00:10:13.800
I want to know more about you.

00:10:13.800 --> 00:10:14.710
But...

00:10:16.160 --> 00:10:18.810
if it's too painful, 
you don't have to tell us.

00:10:18.810 --> 00:10:21.140
Yeah. I feel the same way!

00:10:22.130 --> 00:10:26.100
<i>I understand wanting to know more 
about your comrades, though.</i>

00:10:26.960 --> 00:10:28.780
<i>Because I'm one of theirs!</i>

00:10:30.080 --> 00:10:32.250
I want you both to know.

00:10:32.250 --> 00:10:35.110
May I tell you more about my past?

00:10:35.400 --> 00:10:36.330
Yeah!

00:10:36.330 --> 00:10:37.070
Yes.

00:10:41.080 --> 00:10:43.420
It happened when I was 12 years old.

00:10:44.400 --> 00:10:47.480
My parents were busy that day,

00:10:47.480 --> 00:10:50.460
so they couldn't watch me at taming practice.

00:10:51.200 --> 00:10:56.070
I spent the day on the village 
outskirts, practicing by myself.

00:11:00.670 --> 00:11:02.860
I practiced until sunset,

00:11:03.810 --> 00:11:06.360
and it was only when it got 
dark that I could see it...

00:11:07.900 --> 00:11:11.290
Despite it being nighttime, the sky was red.

00:11:12.650 --> 00:11:14.330
"Something is wrong."

00:11:14.330 --> 00:11:16.940
That was the thought racing through 
my mind as I ran back to the village.

00:11:19.380 --> 00:11:20.360
But...

00:11:22.400 --> 00:11:24.160
by the time I arrived,

00:11:24.160 --> 00:11:25.780
it was already too late.

00:11:27.600 --> 00:11:29.790
The village had been attacked by monsters.

00:11:30.530 --> 00:11:32.920
I was the only survivor.

00:11:35.250 --> 00:11:38.800
It was then that adventurers, realizing 
something was wrong, raced to the scene.

00:11:38.800 --> 00:11:40.310
They took me into custody.

00:11:42.420 --> 00:11:46.480
They took me to an inn that 
belonged to one of their friends.

00:11:46.480 --> 00:11:48.820
I had to work to earn my keep.

00:11:50.310 --> 00:11:52.490
It took all of my effort just to stay alive.

00:11:53.590 --> 00:11:56.250
And that was my life, for years and years.

00:11:57.400 --> 00:11:59.530
Until one day, half a year ago...

00:12:02.770 --> 00:12:04.840
I met Arios and the others.

00:12:06.070 --> 00:12:07.500
Arios?

00:12:07.960 --> 00:12:08.910
The Hero.

00:12:09.670 --> 00:12:12.480
Arios happened to be looking for comrades.

00:12:12.480 --> 00:12:14.370
He invited me to join their party.

00:12:15.250 --> 00:12:17.720
I agreed without a second thought.

00:12:17.720 --> 00:12:21.840
I thought that being part of the Hero's 
party would let me make a difference,

00:12:22.370 --> 00:12:26.800
that I could perhaps prevent another tragedy like that of my hometown,

00:12:27.230 --> 00:12:29.770
but the reality was very different.

00:12:35.650 --> 00:12:39.610
I think Arios just wanted to use me.

00:12:43.080 --> 00:12:43.950
I'm sorry.

00:12:43.950 --> 00:12:45.530
I guess this got a little dark.

00:12:46.160 --> 00:12:48.950
I feel kind of pathetic...

00:12:51.040 --> 00:12:51.980
Kanade?

00:12:52.840 --> 00:12:56.170
I've been wondering about that for a while.

00:12:56.900 --> 00:12:59.540
When we went after the bandits,

00:12:59.540 --> 00:13:02.000
when we fought the king lizard,

00:13:02.000 --> 00:13:04.810
and when you saved me, 
it was always the same...

00:13:05.500 --> 00:13:10.220
Why did you always rush 
headfirst into danger?

00:13:10.220 --> 00:13:14.940
Where did you find the courage 
to do so much to help others?

00:13:15.450 --> 00:13:17.900
Now I finally see.

00:13:19.360 --> 00:13:22.650
You just really want to help people.

00:13:22.650 --> 00:13:28.680
You don't want anyone to 
experience the same sadness you have.

00:13:29.520 --> 00:13:32.080
That's not pathetic at all!

00:13:32.510 --> 00:13:33.720
Kanade...

00:13:36.750 --> 00:13:38.780
You're too kind for your own good.

00:13:38.780 --> 00:13:41.820
You're far too self-effacing, 
and far too earnest.

00:13:41.820 --> 00:13:44.210
It's the worst case I've ever seen, honestly.

00:13:45.060 --> 00:13:47.540
But... it's not necessarily a negative.

00:13:48.510 --> 00:13:54.460
Wh-What I'm saying is, I'm proud 
to have a master like you.

00:13:54.460 --> 00:13:55.100
Yeah.

00:13:55.100 --> 00:13:57.240
That's just who you are, Rein!

00:13:59.270 --> 00:14:00.520
<i>The way I am...</i>

00:14:01.190 --> 00:14:02.440
<i>The time I've spent...</i>

00:14:03.070 --> 00:14:05.190
<i>I feel like it's all been affirmed.</i>

00:14:07.880 --> 00:14:09.240
You guys...

00:14:11.380 --> 00:14:12.660
Although...

00:14:12.660 --> 00:14:15.130
I've never heard of anyone 
stupider than that Hero's party!

00:14:15.130 --> 00:14:17.720
You worked so hard to help and support them,

00:14:17.720 --> 00:14:19.440
and they called you useless?!

00:14:19.440 --> 00:14:21.500
It ticks me off so bad!

00:14:21.500 --> 00:14:22.750
You said it!

00:14:22.750 --> 00:14:25.760
I bet they're really struggling 
without you right now!

00:14:25.760 --> 00:14:27.820
Thanks for getting mad on my behalf...

00:14:27.820 --> 00:14:29.260
But I've moved on, I swear!

00:14:29.260 --> 00:14:31.770
I-It's not all about you, you know!

00:14:31.770 --> 00:14:33.660
It's just so cruel!

00:14:33.660 --> 00:14:35.850
You're nice deep down, Tania!

00:14:35.850 --> 00:14:37.040
Cut it out!

00:14:37.700 --> 00:14:38.990
Someone's blushing!

00:14:38.990 --> 00:14:41.870
No! I'm not blushing!

00:14:43.300 --> 00:14:45.830
<i>I'd love things to remain just the three of us.</i>

00:14:52.510 --> 00:14:53.370
Hey, hey!

00:14:53.370 --> 00:14:55.710
Let's compete to see who can defeat more!

00:14:55.710 --> 00:14:59.840
Goodness! Challenging me to a 
duel is a foolish thing indeed!

00:14:59.840 --> 00:15:00.950
But very well...

00:15:01.330 --> 00:15:03.880
I accept your challenge!

00:15:06.600 --> 00:15:07.670
Well?

00:15:08.300 --> 00:15:11.300
<i>Our job this time is slaying orcs.</i>

00:15:11.300 --> 00:15:13.370
<i>Orcs are E-rank monsters,</i>

00:15:13.370 --> 00:15:16.090
<i>and they aren't much physically 
stronger than goblins.</i>

00:15:16.580 --> 00:15:19.640
<i>But orcs are much smarter,</i>

00:15:19.640 --> 00:15:21.940
<i>and they tend to fight with weapons.</i>

00:15:25.900 --> 00:15:29.580
We might complete this challenge lickety-split!

00:15:29.580 --> 00:15:30.780
Yeah!

00:15:30.780 --> 00:15:32.990
Don't let your guard down, you two.

00:15:33.360 --> 00:15:36.250
We're still new at this, after all.

00:15:36.250 --> 00:15:38.700
Even against orcs, there's always a chance—

00:15:37.120 --> 00:15:38.700
No worries there!

00:15:39.080 --> 00:15:44.040
I, Tania of the dragonoids, would never 
be defeated by a mere band of orcs!

00:15:44.040 --> 00:15:45.340
Now, let's try this way!

00:15:45.340 --> 00:15:46.750
Wait for me!

00:15:46.750 --> 00:15:48.980
I hope it all goes as easy 
as she thinks it will...

00:15:56.110 --> 00:15:57.560
Tania! He's coming for you!

00:15:57.560 --> 00:15:58.890
I've got it handled!

00:16:06.960 --> 00:16:08.410
Far too easy!

00:16:10.120 --> 00:16:12.530
Oh? Did we miss one?

00:16:17.510 --> 00:16:19.210
Hey! What's he doing?

00:16:19.210 --> 00:16:20.320
Let go of me!

00:16:28.820 --> 00:16:30.210
Tania, behind you!

00:16:32.850 --> 00:16:34.010
Rein!

00:16:34.010 --> 00:16:34.970
Take this!

00:16:38.390 --> 00:16:39.310
What do I do?!

00:16:39.310 --> 00:16:40.650
You're bleeding so much...

00:16:40.650 --> 00:16:41.920
Don't worry.

00:16:41.920 --> 00:16:44.070
I told you I could use Heal.

00:16:44.840 --> 00:16:46.860
And I have your magic powering it now, so...

00:16:47.990 --> 00:16:49.030
Heal!

00:16:52.000 --> 00:16:53.590
See? All back to normal!

00:16:54.040 --> 00:16:55.520
I'm just fine, see?

00:16:55.520 --> 00:16:57.070
Don't look so upset, Tania.

00:16:57.070 --> 00:16:59.370
But... it was all my fault...

00:16:59.630 --> 00:17:02.410
You're really fine? It doesn't hurt?

00:17:02.410 --> 00:17:03.420
Just fine.

00:17:03.420 --> 00:17:05.330
Thanks, both of you.

00:17:06.200 --> 00:17:08.320
Let's gather up the rune stones 
and get back to the Guild.

00:17:08.320 --> 00:17:09.180
Roger!

00:17:09.180 --> 00:17:12.010
You rest, Rein. I'll gather them up!

00:17:12.010 --> 00:17:13.420
I told you, I'm fine!

00:17:22.100 --> 00:17:23.320
Sorry for the wait.

00:17:23.320 --> 00:17:23.930
Huh?

00:17:24.430 --> 00:17:25.420
Where's Tania?

00:17:26.310 --> 00:17:28.650
She was here a minute ago, but...

00:17:28.650 --> 00:17:30.810
She seemed a little down...

00:17:32.320 --> 00:17:37.030
It felt like... she wanted to be alone.

00:17:40.400 --> 00:17:42.980
What was I thinking?

00:17:44.290 --> 00:17:46.460
Hey, dragon lady!

00:17:48.620 --> 00:17:51.000
Hey, what did you beat today?

00:17:52.240 --> 00:17:54.540
I didn't beat anything today.

00:17:54.960 --> 00:17:56.250
Really?

00:17:56.730 --> 00:17:58.160
Yes, really.

00:17:58.160 --> 00:18:00.740
Hey, does it hurt anywhere?

00:18:02.360 --> 00:18:05.450
If it hurts, you gotta say so.

00:18:05.450 --> 00:18:07.390
That's what my mom always tells me!

00:18:07.880 --> 00:18:09.200
I see.

00:18:09.200 --> 00:18:10.860
Your mother is very wise.

00:18:11.340 --> 00:18:14.670
Except when she tells me to eat vegetables.

00:18:14.670 --> 00:18:17.080
I do appreciate the concern.

00:18:17.080 --> 00:18:18.570
I'm fine, I promise.

00:18:18.880 --> 00:18:20.090
Okay, great!

00:18:20.090 --> 00:18:21.260
See ya!

00:18:23.900 --> 00:18:27.040
He was... worried about me, wasn't he?

00:18:28.150 --> 00:18:30.470
But I refused to listen.

00:18:30.920 --> 00:18:34.590
I was so high on my own status 
as an ultimate species...

00:18:34.590 --> 00:18:35.880
I let my guard down.

00:18:38.050 --> 00:18:41.660
How can I ever show my 
face to you again, Rein?

00:18:42.260 --> 00:18:43.270
Tania.

00:18:45.380 --> 00:18:47.150
R-Rein?

00:18:47.150 --> 00:18:47.980
What's the matter?

00:18:48.770 --> 00:18:51.420
Well... er... I...

00:18:52.400 --> 00:18:54.690
I'm so sorry about before!

00:18:54.690 --> 00:18:57.650
Y-You were trying to warn me,

00:18:57.650 --> 00:18:59.320
but I let my guard down,

00:18:59.320 --> 00:19:01.610
and got you hurt in the process...

00:19:01.610 --> 00:19:03.720
I know the Heal spell fixed the problem,

00:19:03.720 --> 00:19:06.120
but if things had gone a bit differently...

00:19:06.920 --> 00:19:08.100
So, please...

00:19:08.540 --> 00:19:10.500
accept my apolo—

00:19:10.960 --> 00:19:13.210
Is that what this is about?

00:19:14.450 --> 00:19:16.170
Why aren't you angry?

00:19:17.030 --> 00:19:19.360
Well... you're sorry, aren't you?

00:19:19.360 --> 00:19:21.130
As long as you're more 
careful next time, I'm okay.

00:19:21.770 --> 00:19:23.640
I'm just glad you're safe.

00:19:25.410 --> 00:19:27.340
Kanade was worried, you know?

00:19:28.460 --> 00:19:30.570
Tania! Are you okay?

00:19:30.570 --> 00:19:32.330
I-I'm fine.

00:19:32.330 --> 00:19:34.650
Okay! I'm so glad!

00:19:42.070 --> 00:19:44.080
Hey, has that room opened up yet?

00:19:44.080 --> 00:19:46.030
I'm afraid not!

00:19:46.030 --> 00:19:48.040
Just one more room, please...

00:19:48.040 --> 00:19:49.340
Even a small one, please...

00:19:49.340 --> 00:19:51.300
<i>He didn't scold me for my mistake.</i>

00:19:49.340 --> 00:19:51.390
Just give it your best!

00:19:51.390 --> 00:19:52.920
Seriously, I want a room!

00:19:52.920 --> 00:19:55.060
<i>He didn't get angry, either.</i>

00:19:55.600 --> 00:19:58.380
<i>He was just happy I'm safe.</i>

00:20:06.490 --> 00:20:07.910
<i>A curious person.</i>

00:20:08.520 --> 00:20:11.100
<i>He lets us use the beds, as well.</i>

00:20:11.610 --> 00:20:13.560
<i>Though it must be hard 
to sleep there, I'm sure.</i>

00:20:14.060 --> 00:20:16.140
<i>He's too kind for his own good, but...</i>

00:20:17.680 --> 00:20:19.420
I'm just glad you're safe.

00:20:20.190 --> 00:20:21.480
<i>Why is it?</i>

00:20:21.480 --> 00:20:24.540
<i>Why can't I stop thinking about Rein?</i>

00:20:24.540 --> 00:20:26.780
<i>I feel this warmth in my heart...</i>

00:20:28.720 --> 00:20:31.200
<i>What's going through my head now?!</i>

00:20:32.880 --> 00:20:38.170
<i>It's almost like I'm... 
My feelings for Rein are...</i>

00:20:38.170 --> 00:20:40.060
Fishy, fishy...

00:20:40.760 --> 00:20:41.550
No, absolutely not!

00:20:41.550 --> 00:20:43.100
It can't be true!

00:20:43.100 --> 00:20:44.920
Th-That's right...

00:20:44.920 --> 00:20:49.400
I'm just rather fond of him. 
That's all it is.

00:20:49.400 --> 00:20:52.600
I-I'm not that easy to win over, you know!

00:20:53.170 --> 00:20:57.310
And... don't shake off your covers.

00:21:03.240 --> 00:21:05.530
Good night, Rein.

00:21:10.740 --> 00:21:14.910
More reward! More food!

00:21:12.900 --> 00:21:14.350
What song is that?

00:21:15.370 --> 00:21:18.030
The "successful job" song!

00:21:18.890 --> 00:21:22.110
We've certainly been breezing 
through the jobs of late.

00:21:22.110 --> 00:21:24.790
Might it be time to buy new equipment?

00:21:25.630 --> 00:21:28.540
As ultimate species, 
we don't need any ourselves,

00:21:28.540 --> 00:21:31.000
but you're still just a human.

00:21:32.340 --> 00:21:34.560
Maybe I'll have a look around 
once we're back in town.

00:21:34.560 --> 00:21:35.880
I approve!

00:21:36.410 --> 00:21:37.740
What about food?

00:21:37.740 --> 00:21:39.160
We'll get food first.

00:21:39.520 --> 00:21:40.650
Hooray!

00:21:40.650 --> 00:21:41.900
Let's go fast!

00:21:41.900 --> 00:21:42.730
Of course, of course.

00:21:45.780 --> 00:21:47.160
Rein?

00:21:52.000 --> 00:21:53.100
Hey, there.

00:22:00.110 --> 00:22:03.020
Been a while, Rein.

00:23:35.680 --> 00:23:40.060
Beast Tamer VS Hero

00:23:36.400 --> 00:23:39.800
Next Time: "Beast Tamer VS Hero."
